      "machineHash": "18fe03cf77b8f116c511957e23b69e2652528205710b18d9d9babf768304cb12",
      "machineText": "`NewNotchWindow` 需要 `-tags private_mac_apis`，才能让透明的 Web 内容显露原生刘海形状。没有该标签时，面板、定位和动画仍然有效，但 WebView 会保持不透明。请参阅[私有 macOS API](/guides/build/private-macos-apis/#webview-transparency-and-background)。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "`NewNotchWindow` requires `-tags private_mac_apis` for transparent web content to reveal the native …",
